# 📊 Power BI Sales Analysis Dashboard

## 1. Project Overview
This project focuses on sales data analysis and business performance reporting using Microsoft Power BI. It uses multiple datasets to organize order information, analyze sales performance, and understand monthly sales targets.

## 2. Project Objectives
- Analyze order and sales information.
- Understand category-wise profit performance.
- Analyze sub-category-wise sales amounts.
- Track monthly sales targets.
- Create meaningful business insights using Power BI.

## 3. Dataset Description

The project contains four tables in the Power BI data model.

| Dataset / Table | Description |
|---|---|
| List of Orders | Stores order-related information for order analysis. |
| Order Details | Contains detailed order and sales information. |
| Sales target | Contains sales target information for target analysis. |
| Orders Data | Contains additional order-related data used in the model. |

### Dataset Purpose
- Order analysis using order information.
- Sales analysis using order details.
- Profit analysis across categories.
- Monthly sales target analysis.
- Combining multiple tables for business reporting.

*Note: Individual column names, row counts, and data types are not included because they could not be verified from the available file metadata.*

